**Evaluating layout changes**

I'm considering the new layout changes, specifically that the latest patch adds top padding equal to the toolbar height plus a gap to ensure code text isn’t covered. But I’m noticing that if the toolbar isn’t selected, an extra blank space remains. This seems to contradict the goal of avoiding layout changes. Actually, it looks like the code block used to always display the toolbar in-flow, so maybe that setup was initially different.
