**Considering layout constraints**

I’m thinking about layout positioning and the ability to overflow. It looks like I can only overflow to the left by 6; the right side doesn’t have that option, which feels negligible. I could apply a left inset to keep things within bounds. If I use PositionedDirectional, it might create a tight width instead of shrinking. Aligning with Padding could be a better approach to achieve the desired effect. There's definitely some tweaking to do!
